[delegate] validator <- Validate analysis/brief.md against analysis/source-map.md and the source/ files: confirm every one of the 18 flagged C-to-Rust gaps has a concrete, non-contradictory Rust resolution; confirm the 9 frozen contracts (public API signatures, Timeval field types, sane_ctype semantics, timezone_names ordering, tm_to_time_t sentinel, special table order, match_string return contract, parse_date_basic offset out-param) are internally consistent and match the actual C source; confirm the target crate layout (8 files under target/src/ + tests + benches) is buildable and that the test strategy covers all 3 C test functions plus the 7 new characterization tests. Report any gap, contradiction, or missing resolution as a defect list.
