[delegate] translator <- Translate Batch 1 of the migration plan (meta/plan.md, Batch 1) into the target crate: create target/Cargo.toml (crate manifest with libc dependency and a [[bench]] section, derived from source/Makefile), target/src/ctype.rs (from approxidate.c:1-70: the 256-entry sane_ctype table with SANE_S/A/D bit-flag semantics, sane_isdigit/sane_isalpha/sane_isalnum/sane_toupper predicates, and the sane_case helper), and a target/src/lib.rs skeleton (pub mod declarations for ctype/tables/matchers/parse_basic/relative, pub struct Timeval { tv_sec: i64, tv_usec: i64 }, pub enum ParseError { Failed } implementing std::error::Error + Display, and declared-but-unimplemented public stubs for approxidate/approxidate_relative). Follow the frozen contracts in analysis/brief.md (Timeval i64 fields, ParseError public enum, sane_ctype 256-entry bit-flag table). Do not implement the public functions yet (that is Batch 5). Verify `cargo build` succeeds and `cargo test` passes before reporting.
